cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Wave Optics Simulation"
abstract: >-
  An interactive simulator for 2D wave optics, in which light is a complex
  scalar field summed from point sources rather than a bundle of rays, with an
  assignment system for teaching. A fork of the Ray Optics Simulation, which it
  still contains.
type: software
authors:
